# Regenerated by the GTK spike test on every run (fresh asset ids each time).
# Not deleted by the test: GTK keeps in-memory graph objects for imported graphs,
# and deleting the files under them makes the editor throw on each domain reload.
Assets/Spikes/GtSpike/TestArtifacts/
